From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:12:56 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 100/102] ui-egui, app: office overlay hook (name, icon,
 version, attribution)

Adds a build-script/overlay module pair (build_office.rs, office_overlay.rs) that renders
OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR/overlay.env into constants, and routes the app name, window and
presenter titles, window icon, About heading/version/attribution, dialog titles, the
native-format labels, palette labels and the web start error through it (rebrand() at each
literal: deckcraft has no catalog lookup to hook). Without OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR every value
is upstream's own.
